                                "text": "brotherly love"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "848370d2-f71f-4d7c-be5b-5220bdbf8079",
                                "sense_id": "89aacbf8-5681-3eea-a65a-1e31ea2f44bd",
                                "text": "Do not despair. To be friendless is indeed to be unfortunate, but the hearts of men, when unprejudiced by any obvious self-interest, are full of brotherly love and charity."
                            }
                        ]
